{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 32, :comments ["<b>And they sent the coat of many stripes, and brought it to their father.</b> The emissaries brought it. And this is what is said, ״the coat of your son״ — for had the brothers brought it, they would have said, ״the coat of Joseph.״ Some interpreted וישלחו in the sense of (Job 36:12) ״בשלח יעבורו״, that it returned and they brought it to the brothers, and this is their cruelty."], :book :genesis, :voice :rabbeinu-bahya, :lang :en, :chapter 37, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T14:18:24.177896691Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}